<title>USA: Mass. says will sell $300 mln GO bonds June 24.</title>
<headline>Mass. says will sell $300 mln GO bonds June 24.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Massachusetts said it will sell $300 million of general obligation bonds June 24 through competitive auction.</p>
<p>The auction is slated for 1000 EDT. --U.S. Municipal Desk, 212-859-1650</p>
</text>
